# Me Via You theme (locked)

Canonical source: `src/lib/styles/theme.css` and `src/lib/theme.ts`.

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| background | `#060B0F` | Page canvas |
| foreground | `#E8E4F0` | Body text (off-white) |
| primary | `#A50036` | Main CTAs, negatives, active states, primary links, focus rings |
| positive | `#0E7A36` | Positive answers, positive form classification |
| accent | `#5D0EC0` | Secondary actions, info surfaces, outline/ghost hovers |
| destructive | `#E5484D` | Close actions, errors, validation failures, irreversible actions |

## Rules

- Use Tailwind semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-primary`, `text-accent`, `border-border`) — never hardcode hex in components.
- Do not change palette values without an explicit user request.
- Icons and PWA manifest must stay aligned with `theme.ts` (`background`, `primary`, `accent`).
